{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Eng_Title.png?t=1745257270\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Des_Pushing.gif?t=1745257270\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Treasure 'n Trio\u00a0</strong>is a single-player puzzle game based on the classic Sokoban.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player moves tile by tile, pushing objects and interacting with various puzzle mechanisms to progress through the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Eng_Trio.png?t=1745257270\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Des_Trio.gif?t=1745257270\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can control three unique characters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A warrior who solves everything with brute force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A thief who ignores most dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cowardly wizard with teleportation magic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can\u2019t solve the puzzles using just one character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use each one wisely to overcome the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Eng_Fantasy.png?t=1745257270\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Des_Fantasy.gif?t=1745257270\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From peaceful forests to dangerous areas filled with bubbling lava,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">each world offers a unique theme and a new kind of puzzle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter distinctive monsters and puzzle elements that change with every world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Eng_Treasure.png?t=1745257270\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Des_Treasure.gif?t=1745257270\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every journey deserves a reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a variety of unexpected treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you gather them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Eng_Side.png?t=1745257270\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Des_Side.gif?t=1745257270\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For those seeking an extra challenge, side quests are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These are high-difficulty modes where you must solve the same level under special conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Give the 