 of unexpected treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you gather them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Eng_Side.png?t=1745257270\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/Des_Side.gif?t=1745257270\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For those seeking an extra challenge, side quests are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These are high-difficulty modes where you must solve the same level under special conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Give the side quests a try as well.</p>","developers":["TNT"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/header.jpg?t=1745257270","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128881,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128881/movie480.mp4?t=1745257263","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128881/movie_max.mp4?t=1745257263"},"name":"Treasure 'n Trio: Tri-Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128881/2d6a411417a45e42b5fab1bd65da204661e5cb36/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745257263","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128881/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745257263","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128881/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745257263"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257061644,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061644/movie480.mp4?t=1745257266","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061644/movie_max.mp4?t=174